            "name": "Bites",
            "description": "Melee weapon attack: +4 to hit, reach 0ft, one target in the swarm's space. Hit: 10 (4d4) piercing damage, or 5 (2d4) if the swarm has half its hit points or fewer. Target must make DC 10 Constitution save or contract Ashen Rash - disadvantage on Stealth checks due to violent coughing for 1 hour."
          }
        ],
